  "clips": [
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L001_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L001",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Прибыв на верфь Каллисто, Мика доверил корабль специалистам.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "047b0e4ec8845e1c738ba354f4ba2c43ebb57e4cb6720dbc7076683d8e2026ac",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L002",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_016",
      "role": "engineer_1",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Корпус крепкий… Но волновой двигатель для таких прыжков слаб!",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
      "sha256": "6a39ad1004264220a9cf42f4de36963a5406c34646a29673a72d737a72ae822f",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L003",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_017",
      "role": "engineer_2",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Как он вообще пережил ту космическую бурю?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2",
      "sha256": "9bc9e36fc3bb2564d16cd0f4fd7c408747f41f3e0dd647d92d156406e23547a5",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L004",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Почему мне нельзя лететь дальше? Мне же нужно в другую галактику!",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "794cb1887e4074b61e6a4ad80b3c4fe9d10bab6d90f18d93f2073b4216fdb001",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L005",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_018",
      "role": "service_staff",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Прости, Мика. Твой корабль не выдержит такого прыжка. Мы всё проверили… но здесь бессильны.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 6960,
      "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "sha256": "6b0102b60ffc22c3ba51bbb78462286634d8edd9515769ebb9bd16a031684fca",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L006",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Мика совсем приуныл. Неужели дорога домой закончится здесь?..",
      "emotion_tag": "[sadly]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "3a626a5521040e3bbeda5ec9924857713987593f3591f52549252a6474ca24cd",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L007",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Эй, юный путешественник! Кажется, я знаю, как тебе помочь!",
      "emotion_tag": "[cheerfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4640,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "29af013dce32052b6be31a6e3663208db5bdbf22b4fc523545f8f04a3520c24d",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L008_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L008",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Профессор — непризнанный гений верфи Каллисто.",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "5a097ed009c7c40cd90a374524339182c629cd65a3c4562f6a9d226c73920d84",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L012_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L012",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Добавим к волновому ядру квантовый фазосдвигатель. Он согнёт пространство — и мы перескочим в другую галактику!",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 7600,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "d875cd08efb36c2851e6e5b88996a554d500347c12b64872960c90f7ea9af022",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L013_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L013",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Э-э… чего?",
      "emotion_tag": "[confused]",
      "duration_ms": 1920,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "fd6550a7072eaee2c45002e236630374c8f0d16b96e7ccfce82257517188d662",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L015_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L015",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "После долгих проб, споров и россыпи искр корабль наконец удалось модернизировать!",
      "emotion_tag": "[triumphantly]",
      "duration_ms": 6240,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "0339d017e7d6d82f49e7cdac44a5a5635f6d312ba40f75186f17c86aefa27413",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH01_P07_L016_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L016",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "ru",
      "text": "Перед стартом друзья пополнили запасы и отправились в путь. Впереди их ждало долгое путешествие!",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 6960,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "09dfa0899dd8ef5a3745424589b1799cfddcc49cd48559821e08704c25d6f39b",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L001",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "At Callisto Shipyard, Mika trusted the experts with his little ship.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "6c04ec0124849e2b61df3d65ffc07906274397534a4b1c6134ca5b10cdb62227",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L002",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_016",
      "role": "engineer_1",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The hull is sound… But this wave engine is too weak for that jump!",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
      "sha256": "9c1c66a1b03aed62067df44683b585a158b575953aa9164620a955416a8d2349",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L003",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_017",
      "role": "engineer_2",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "How did it even survive that cosmic storm?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 3280,
      "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2",
      "sha256": "a8e2e0294d4074b14b0d4a842460ad246c1572ae9fffe46354103bafee36434f",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L004",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Why can’t I go on? I need to reach another galaxy!",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "b636bcb5df62586542ad077f3c43367ffb47c31dbdcfe64af3e4a000d74d2626",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L005",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_018",
      "role": "service_staff",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "I’m sorry, Mika. Your ship wouldn’t survive that jump. We checked everything… but we can’t fix it here.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 7760,
      "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "sha256": "465967e52233f9b17a9b8d9a69a211364677ab53603f45f1c0ec71781c84892d",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L006",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Mika’s heart sank. Could his journey home really end right here?..",
      "emotion_tag": "[sadly]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "c3ef67d2886fa00d3e04432868db76e64c56cd58e014f26c50e29a9758e29c38",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L007",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Hey, young traveler! I think I know how to help you!",
      "emotion_tag": "[cheerfully]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "9a4de7ec8b6d6aa66bd63ef204d449bb9d888803a4fe95dc4f9e911f85cd099b",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L008_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L008",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The professor: Callisto’s brilliant but unsung genius.",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4720,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "4954195e41de13d3c02aab7ac0c50a305a584199eea4357786ee9fa5ee7f1262",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L012_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L012",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Add a quantum phase shifter to the wave core. It’ll bend space itself— and we’ll hop straight into another galaxy!",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 7040,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "9d0ffd48b8d5289aaccdabefe2b2da577cb3e165ae7ce5a6b3c51f19cf2b0276",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L013_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L013",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Uh… what?",
      "emotion_tag": "[confused]",
      "duration_ms": 1840,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "2a53f9186c327bbd8828f7bab7c0322e9dee47945afcb94db5f6b44a2faab4d8",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L015_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L015",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "After days of trials, doubts and flying sparks, they finally upgraded Mika’s ship!",
      "emotion_tag": "[triumphantly]",
      "duration_ms": 6320,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "10715e9af17b90e9a414c1984561bc39111d5b86a76f879561a8cc6396f67aa8",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH01_P07_L016_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L016",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Before takeoff, our friends restocked and set off. A long journey was waiting for them!",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 5920,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "765b8f13ea27e52fd98efeaf6b57401eef40f88de7e106ba93653449ca65d473",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L001",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "No estaleiro de Calisto, Mika deixou sua nave nas mãos dos técnicos.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "ea2074b8a9e84e8bd9209ce60967d5582b89ef102440e17e38868a8ceb3be15c",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L002",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_016",
      "role": "engineer_1",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "O casco está ótimo… Mas o motor de ondas não aguenta esse salto!",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
      "sha256": "f6d728d33ed4728a923bfe35395e56ac108f51a2f8b67c0b925ea307ef1441e0",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L003",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_017",
      "role": "engineer_2",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "Como ela sobreviveu àquela tempestade?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 2880,
      "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2",
      "sha256": "b35ecf465f1fc4225709c99b25ef0e53cc0a6b3639298af90145b1b778196358",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L004",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "Por que não posso seguir? Eu preciso chegar a outra galáxia!",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "454240d5d1f789039af67435994d486c31e1c2909beb2445a7a7ecd1d2deaa69",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L005",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_018",
      "role": "service_staff",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "Sinto muito, Mika. Sua nave não aguentaria esse salto. Testamos de tudo… mas não dá pra ajudar.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 7840,
      "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "sha256": "acb1e7a5da78f1d13f0ec3710f0ee3ef8c0e990988ad29f16eb5115aad952308",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L006",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "Mika ficou arrasado. Será que o caminho de volta terminava ali mesmo?..",
      "emotion_tag": "[sadly]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "fc234b37ed5bfc228da3d3e8bdbf3b10f0935e522472e8ca46821e5c08ec2d78",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L007_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L007",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "Ei, jovem viajante! Acho que eu sei como te ajudar!",
      "emotion_tag": "[cheerfully]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "420a7bf144f277b9809a200c10fdf6d6ecb02ae621d24a66708d8a788b2d6d90",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L008_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L008",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "Era o professor: um gênio incompreendido de Calisto.",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "af305cd6e31c30cf1f8494a081c1fcdced23b28e7a322c90d2026dc6e7d5ef34",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L012_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L012",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "Vamos acoplar um deslocador quântico de fase ao núcleo de ondas. Dobramos o espaço… e pulamos de galáxia!",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 7120,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "44c73635f73b130eecea53ee04b03ec31e11576cf457ac14c5f7ab7240a113e4",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L013_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L013",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "Hã… como é?",
      "emotion_tag": "[confused]",
      "duration_ms": 1760,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "56e83a044d4dfe7ae77132725147cbe668f1dfe36e141aea50d7d9b2400c43ae",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L015_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L015",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "Depois de testes, dúvidas e muitas faíscas, a nave enfim ficou pronta para o salto!",
      "emotion_tag": "[triumphantly]",
      "duration_ms": 6240,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "f01d34415e9012ee8af4e8f322f82bbc4b272301010f0238101f585eff6dbfcb",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH01_P07_L016_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L016",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "text": "Antes de partir, os amigos reabasteceram a nave e seguiram viagem. Uma longa jornada os esperava!",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 7040,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "57a3792fe20608da0836670667cbfbb7341052a482e6979ae8e793d35d630574",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L001",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "En el astillero de Calisto, Mika dejó su nave en manos de expertos.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "c502da241edb092d03814bf1a87db7df30514193a46fc89893e98a4e4c7f776e",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L002",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_016",
      "role": "engineer_1",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "El casco está bien… Pero este motor de ondas no soporta ese salto.",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
      "sha256": "44c257ee995bad8ebbeb90f644162a4db409bffbeb0016fec0f52e6ea41f032b",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L003",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_017",
      "role": "engineer_2",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "¿Cómo sobrevivió a esa tormenta cósmica?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 3040,
      "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2",
      "sha256": "9381cd095587db6522a846d541df9543ce2afd8f12e5ebd8502a6b06f953f9a9",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L004",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "¿Por qué no puedo seguir? ¡Necesito llegar a otra galaxia!",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "a8ec160824e553dc767c39f30d8f27266ab0238fef2203f0bfd56e3e27532844",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L005",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_018",
      "role": "service_staff",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "Lo siento, Mika. Tu nave no resistiría ese salto. Lo revisamos todo… aquí no podemos ayudarte.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 8160,
      "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "sha256": "c665f271a2f23aaee415278a6fc7875882ca32af28bfb2adbb27ce3cfe8e0a3e",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L006",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "Mika se desanimó. ¿De verdad el camino a casa terminaría allí?..",
      "emotion_tag": "[sadly]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "9977c5b3091ed31b6febb3f7d540e1708ae3a96194de5a580935f7e9174420d1",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L007",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "¡Eh, joven viajero! Creo que sé cómo ayudarte!",
      "emotion_tag": "[cheerfully]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "d18175ad96b0e8ad28767a07f8292525e76bd6390e7957c56a882466a47032aa",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L008_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L008",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "El profesor: un genio incomprendido de Calisto.",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "63c7a9d86ef643777f8ade4ae152a1fcf376a96f116e6f6677aaf0500df0389b",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L012_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L012",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "Pondremos un desfasador cuántico en el núcleo de ondas. Doblará el espacio… ¡y daremos un salto hasta otra galaxia!",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "bd263cd8d2c78c992d7d4273caebd52444a116b7e453f72b7a748aa3b84fca36",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L013_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L013",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "Eh… ¿qué?",
      "emotion_tag": "[confused]",
      "duration_ms": 1600,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "c07565c9709c7db737eebde4f72ec26583e670d891774b5284b7dec7f2761835",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L015_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L015",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "Tras pruebas, dudas y un montón de chispas, ¡por fin modernizaron la nave!",
      "emotion_tag": "[triumphantly]",
      "duration_ms": 5520,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "d0f7d2323d764f26254b741f6fe5269e5ce64c792bb92078a9bccdbb3786073f",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH01_P07_L016_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L016",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "es",
      "text": "Antes de partir, nuestros amigos repusieron sus provisiones y salieron. ¡Les esperaba un largo viaje!",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 6560,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "a7887414526f56152ad4c63e8124306cfd6bc76e50b43f420f30278078b71ff4",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L001",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Au chantier de Callisto, Mika confia son vaisseau aux spécialistes.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "9161bfaa48239bc97eb098fa61769ea37f17d5236ff41d7e50e2a71cc2380f13",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L002",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_016",
      "role": "engineer_1",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "La coque est solide… Mais ce moteur à ondes ne tiendra pas le saut !",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
      "sha256": "0b6c68a93f96ee22de4ef6fca24bde83f05e57d4d737f6a707d7d0ad0530a40c",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L003",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_017",
      "role": "engineer_2",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Comment a-t-il survécu à cette tempête cosmique ?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 3280,
      "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2",
      "sha256": "37f67002a4c660b0b588b74c296a780a240ddc28370caebbad83cc6976e07dc4",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L004",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Pourquoi je dois rester ? Je dois atteindre une autre galaxie !",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "a91169c08d82b561ae96a8a130c36d525125fde84feb095c0e7a955ebea9dd1c",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L005",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_018",
      "role": "service_staff",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Désolée, Mika. Ton vaisseau ne tiendra pas ce saut. On a tout vérifié… on ne peut rien y faire.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "sha256": "6d2db33a12cec91468bdfbdc373cb44fe72154e6c023e409518fab5660c4bebf",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L006",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Mika perdit courage. Et si son voyage vers la maison s’arrêtait ici?..",
      "emotion_tag": "[sadly]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "9fde5f320f2b640661ddeaa40680bbe8976dea57bda59d986bfd44490a0dd5f8",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L007",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Hé, jeune voyageur ! Je crois savoir comment t’aider !",
      "emotion_tag": "[cheerfully]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "b83eb2748005bfc3671d0853a040e87ac724ef626a73b50a0e7652d5ef6bd910",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L008_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L008",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Le professeur : un génie méconnu de Callisto.",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "977f4e85e4b0ccbaa6c58ba6cd89dde99cf803e7bf9f00e8a3b553ff965f1793",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L012_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L012",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Ajoutons un déphaseur quantique au cœur ondulatoire. Il va plier l’espace… et hop ! Nous filerons dans une autre galaxie !",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 7600,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "6862c15da397c5260829ae4ff92477add34b871b2db0e5e927c4f877cf1066b6",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L013_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L013",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Euh… quoi ?",
      "emotion_tag": "[confused]",
      "duration_ms": 1600,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "6641c6c3779436a134403a7073d3a04ff6b64937bb4184140c220179047d0f6d",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L015_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L015",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Après des essais, des doutes et des étincelles, le vaisseau fut enfin prêt pour le grand saut !",
      "emotion_tag": "[triumphantly]",
      "duration_ms": 5840,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "5789a81d5891d30a8cfb5c6cf16b82a540949a8b7399e6331d0a89e9ca6926c5",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH01_P07_L016_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L016",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "fr",
      "text": "Avant le départ, nos amis ont refait leurs réserves et pris la route. Un long voyage les attendait !",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 5840,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "bba984c74ae8e3c2cd9c2037df683aa20d395b3d09f47d250a13985a099d7e4a",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH01_P07_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L001",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "de",
      "text": "Auf Kallistos Werft gab Mika sein Schiff in Expertenhände.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "428fb300c1ef76f8645168870cad9b054622a11b06beb4f95b31c7b5cc56c2fd",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH01_P07_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L002",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_016",
      "role": "engineer_1",
      "language": "de",
      "text": "Die Hülle ist stabil… Aber dieser Wellenantrieb schafft so einen Sprung nie!",
      "emotion_tag": "[concerned]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
      "sha256": "39093959b249abcde800a6023cd1cbfb833d03443f7b9997e895b8ebc58c2e91",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH01_P07_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L003",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_017",
      "role": "engineer_2",
      "language": "de",
      "text": "Wie hat es nur diesen Sturm überlebt?!",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 2960,
      "voice_id": "Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2",
      "sha256": "39fd7d0d3b0511bc4176ab0732a2e47124276fb5e6c96a4c58500f03b21cb76b",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH01_P07_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L004",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "de",
      "text": "Warum darf ich nicht weiter? Ich muss doch in eine andere Galaxie!",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 4240,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "84e926ba4e2dda053c214414d3c1b5881c31379b73b6c5ef1ea1244f6eb9fbef",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH01_P07_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L005",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_018",
      "role": "service_staff",
      "language": "de",
      "text": "Tut mir leid, Mika. Dein Schiff hält diesen Sprung nicht aus. Wir haben alles geprüft… hier können wir nicht helfen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 7520,
      "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "sha256": "4f6b7fe8c5de730cc3b65df48899cba185b86f256131cedce288b8649098ec2b",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH01_P07_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L006",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "de",
      "text": "Mika war ganz bedrückt. War seine Reise nach Hause hier etwa zu Ende?..",
      "emotion_tag": "[sadly]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "963c74589454fce7aa803c1a68c2561d5bb34f8ef5ce3bbd761a91646c5e911b",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH01_P07_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L007",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "de",
      "text": "He, junger Reisender! Ich glaube, ich weiß, wie ich dir helfen kann!",
      "emotion_tag": "[cheerfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4720,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "219c2ee1a7d73f001c263981349850e66bca208dbaea166d768bb0af56b976f3",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH01_P07_L008_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L008",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "language": "de",
      "text": "Der Professor: das verkannte Genie von Kallisto.",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "sha256": "238ad80534f9d21c737910d5afbcf1da2bc4c6b7725b5e7b1df926ae312995c7",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH01_P07_L012_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L012",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "language": "de",
      "text": "Wir koppeln einen Quanten- Phasenschieber an den Wellenkern. Er krümmt den Raum – und zack! Ab in die nächste Galaxie!",
      "emotion_tag": "[excited]",
      "duration_ms": 7440,
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "sha256": "81f6838f980b4bece1fdd4530fe4418cd061a8e2235ddeb40b06238ccc98d44f",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH01_P07_L013_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH01_P07_L013",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "language": "de",
      "text": "Äh… bitte?",
      "emotion_tag": "[confused]",
      "duration_ms": 1760,
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "sha256": "ed83f18e5ce605a18ded6c7d43c057dc60234d42f91997f1d4937dd592c4ceb5",
      "source": "elevenlabs_generated_clip"
    },
